sis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["feipin-q-1bff281cc78188483574"]},"ordering_evidence":"feipin-q-1bff281cc78188483574","order":9056},{"id":"feipin-e-71e6ec4d241131db4eb2","title":"步夫人葬蒋陵","accounts":[{"id":"feipin-a-71e6ec4d241131db4eb2","label":"正文","text":"步夫人葬蒋陵","evidence":["feipin-q-fdcc9c1c38f9619bcc0e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0093","role":"葬者","evidence":["feipin-q-fdcc9c1c38f9619bcc0e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["feipin-q-fdcc9c1c38f9619bcc0e"]},"ordering_evidence":"feipin-q-fdcc9c1c38f9619bcc0e","order":9057}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0093","name":"步氏（孙权夫人）","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o123","feipin-q-1bff281cc78188483574","feipin-q-aafe5b249cdf7dc8deb2","feipin-q-fdcc9c1c38f9619bcc0e","feipin-q-4564917dd4614bf08e3a","feipin-q-a903d94ab0103eb7006f","feipin-q-15a1a2bb8945bf114d31"],"facts":[{"id":"feipin-f-4685aec0e7abe7ec4103","text":"籍贯：临淮淮阴","evidence":["feipin-q-a903d94ab0103eb7006f"]},{"id":"feipin-f-a48c90e264e8eea6e7d4","text":"同族：步骘","evidence":["feipin-q-15a1a2bb8945bf114d31"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wuzhu-m-o123-wuzhu-p0093","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o123"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"feipin-q-15a1a2bb8945bf114d31","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-d2dc14d313c8506f172c","layer":"original","quote":"与丞相骘同族","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":63,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":14,"end":20},{"id":"feipin-q-1bff281cc78188483574","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-2eb2908580187c13376e","layer":"original","quote":"权为王及帝，意欲以为后；而群臣议在徐氏，权依违者十余年〖5〗。然宫内皆称“皇后”，亲戚上疏称“中宫”〖6〗。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":64,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54},{"id":"feipin-q-4564917dd4614bf08e3a","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-d2dc14d313c8506f172c","layer":"original","quote":"吴主权步夫人，临淮淮阴人也。与丞相骘同族〖1〗。汉末，其母携将徙庐江。庐江为孙策所破，皆东渡江。以美丽得幸于权，宠冠后庭。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":63,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61},{"id":"feipin-q-a903d94ab0103eb7006f","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-d2dc14d313c8506f172c","layer":"original","quote":"吴主权步夫人，临淮淮阴人也。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":63,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14},{"id":"feipin-q-aafe5b249cdf7dc8deb2","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-6f6ca26e87a44bb8c285","layer":"original","quote":"及薨，臣下缘权指〖7〗，请追正名号。乃赠印绶，策命曰：“惟赤乌元年闰月戊子〖8〗，皇帝曰：呜呼皇后！惟后佐命，共承天地；虔恭夙夜，与朕均劳。内教修整，礼义不愆〖9〗；宽容慈惠，有淑懿之德：民臣悬望，远近归心。朕以世难未夷，大统未一；缘后雅志，每怀谦损：是以于时，未授名号。亦必谓后降年有永〖10〗，永与朕躬对扬天休〖11〗。不悟奄忽〖12〗，大命近止；朕恨本意，不早昭显；伤后殂逝，不终天禄〖13〗。愍悼之至，痛于厥心！今使使持节、丞相、醴陵（亭）侯雍〖14〗，奉策授号，配食先后〖15〗。魂而有灵，嘉其宠荣。呜呼哀哉！”","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":261},{"id":"feipin-q-fdcc9c1c38f9619bcc0e","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-3168fd55dfbd7a88454c","layer":"original","quote":"葬于蒋陵。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":5},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：景初二年（公元 238 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-917b5dc4aecce5a0dcf4","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"mingdi-q-o059","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5790b2efe14805978c50","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，诏太尉司马宣王。率众讨辽东。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o123a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-0526f0e9023ccf679570","layer":"original","quote":"秋八月，武昌言麒麟现〖1〗。有司奏言：“麒麟者，太平之应，宜改年号。”诏曰：“间者赤乌集于殿前〖2〗，朕所亲见。若神灵以为嘉祥者，改年宜以赤乌为元。”群臣奏曰：“昔武王伐纣〖3〗，有赤乌之祥〖4〗；君臣观之，遂有天下：圣人书策，载述最详者。以为近事既嘉，亲见又明也。”于是改年。步夫人卒〖5〗，追赠皇后。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":152},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o121","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-31d80fea6e868f721c62","layer":"original","quote":"赤乌元年春，铸当千大钱。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":12},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o123","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-0526f0e9023ccf679570","layer":"original","quote":"秋八月，武昌言麒麟现〖1〗。有司奏言：“麒麟者，太平之应，宜改年号。”诏曰：“间者赤乌集于殿前〖2〗，朕所亲见。若神灵以为嘉祥者，改年宜以赤乌为元。”群臣奏曰：“昔武王伐纣〖3〗，有赤乌之祥〖4〗；君臣观之，遂有天下：圣人书策，载述最详者。以为近事既嘉，亲见又明也。”于是改年。步夫人卒〖5〗，追赠皇后。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":152}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
